{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If object detected, move, grab, check properties, do task, move to destination. If blocked, turn around or move.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectDetected    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <Action ID = MoveForward    /> <Action ID = TurnAround    /> <Condition ID = IsPathBlocked    /> <Condition ID = IsPathClear    />",
